<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-BCH Q1 net attrib up 20.2 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-BCH Q1 net attrib up 20.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are financial analysts on average forecasts for first-quarter 1997 earnings at Banco Central Hispanoamericano SA. Results are due on Thursday. In billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   Q1 1997    Q1 1996	Range</p>
<p>    Net interest income     72.23	68.03    70.80-74.00</p>
<p>    Operating margin	  29.27	24.77    27.50-31.30</p>
<p>    Attributable profit     12.46	10.37    12.00-13.60</p>
<p>Contributors: Ahorro Corporacion, Ibersecurities, Benito y Monjardin, Merrill Lynch and Inverban.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2159</p>
